WEBVTT

00:17:57.954 --> 00:18:00.913
Courage is fear walking.

00:18:03.163 --> 00:18:06.246
Neither of us knew that in 10 short
years he would be gone.

00:18:07.288 --> 00:18:11.496
And the time for each of us is all
too precious and all too brief.

00:18:12.829 --> 00:18:14.746
But when our moment comes.

00:18:15.663 --> 00:18:22.913
To face our fragility in that ultimate
time, it will ask us, are you agile?

00:18:23.788 --> 00:18:29.496
Are you agile? Let the moment
be an unreserved yes.